{"type":"message_deleted","timestamp":"2026-07-21T14:50:01.417Z","details":{"message_id":"1526100410211762207","channel_id":"1322620025483559045","channel_name":"🎮-the-finals","author_id":"1501319930136498371","author_tag":"kailimmm","content":"!!!!!PLEASE MAKE RANKED HEAD TO HEAD ALREADY!!!!\n\nThis petition was created with the intention of replacing the current ranked system. Me, many other ranked grinders and pros have found the ranked system to be extremely unfair quite frequelently and we found that it fails to reward skill. Instead, it usually rewards the less riskier plays (third parties, teaming, griefing etc...) which ultimately creates a pretty unfun ranked experience. We believe that changing the ranked gamemode is necessary for these reasons :\n\nChanging the ranked gamemode from cashout to head to head would ultimately provide a more skillfull exprience where a player has to be good to win the game.\n\n \n\nMaking ranked head to head would also provide a reason to play cashout since there would be no other way of playing the gamemode.\n\n \n\nThe finals prides itself over risky plays and skill expression. That said, with the current cashout gamemode, most players end up \"teaming\" with the most skilled team and/or go for third parties. Not a risky last second push.\n\n\n\nThe finals griefing situation is extremely bad at higher ranks. So much so that me and many other players have been forced to basically play a social game and try and be liked by as many ruby players as possible to hopefully get griefed in by them.\n\nHere is the petition :\nhttps://form.jotform.com/261930567212253\nHi so uhhh the petition is a free plan and theres a max of 10 signed per month so if u dont mind sending me a dm with \"signed\" instead of clicking on the link, that would make my day","was_in_archive":false,"original_timestamp":"2026-07-13T05:38:11.369Z"},"previous_hash":"5b642aaf9972e28659a1ea0d02df47b44138c679650e878908dfe62ed7a7b96c","hash":"3ac19de986acbce9a5a1491ff